<title>USA: U.S. Rentals buys Construction Rental.</title>
<headline>U.S. Rentals buys Construction Rental.</headline>
<dateline>MODESTO, Calif. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Rentals Inc said it acquired Construction Rental &amp; Supply Co, the third-largest equipment rental company in Utah.</p>
<p>It said it paid an undisclosed cash amount.</p>
</text>
